      "id": "claim_a150a202e69a43cfac2935faca8d8cff",
      "statement": "HttpClientUtil.createHttpRequest generates a fresh UTC X-OP-Date and X-OP-Expires, selects the HTTP or HTTPS Vert.x client based on the configured service URL scheme, computes an OWS1 signature via the Authorization library, and attaches Accept, Content-Type, Content-Length, X-OP-Date, X-OP-Expires, and X-OP-Authorization headers to every outbound request.",
      "evidence": [
